5AC : First hit of the auto-combo, can only be canceled into a follow-up or an ender.
----
5AC > C : Follow-up that can be canceled into any ender or REV Blow. A simple way to deal more damage, increase the REV, or reduce the opponent’s guard bar(Overheat).
