|description2=*236236B is Ken's highest damage Ignition Gear, mainly done after sideswitch Dragonlash or cancelled into from EX moves like DP, Jinrai, or Hadouken.
*236236D has full invincibility and can be Braked for a combo extension.
----
B version : Excellent damage but slightly harder to juggle into than Shoryureppa due to its slower startup. Ken generally has to spend an EX DP to super cancel into this from most routes to guarantee a hit, however it is much better in whiff punishes or general confirming.

----
D version : Braking this move against grounded opponent will let you get a combo for potentially slightly higher damage and some of your meter back; +4 on grounded connect means you can link B tatsu, while against a launched opponent you can go into any DP or 214BD. Unlike the B version, this is fast enough to always combo off a DP brake, and it allows Ken the flexibility of going straight into this in a low-scaling combo for max damage, while still being able to cash out in a longer combo off an EX DP super cancel.
* As a general rule of thumb, if no EX moves (or REV blow counter starter) are used, going straight into this '''without''' a EX DP super cancel will do more damage.
